     A* =================================================================
     A* File Name   : EXTRPGPF
     A* Description : Consolidated RPG Extracted Source Records PF
     A* Format Name : EXTRPGR
     A* Author      : IBM i Extraction Utility Team
     A* =================================================================
     A          R EXTRPGR                   TEXT('Consolidated RPG Source Record')
     A            SRCLIB        10A         COLHDG('Source' 'Library')
     A            SRCFILE       10A         COLHDG('Source' 'File')
     A            SRCMBR        10A         COLHDG('Source' 'Member')
     A            SRCTYPE       10A         COLHDG('Source' 'Type')
     A            SRCSEQ         6S 2       COLHDG('Source' 'Seq')
     A            SRCDAT         6S 0       COLHDG('Source' 'Date')
     A            SRCDTA       256A         COLHDG('Source' 'Data')
